  "transcript": {
    "text": "Last night the power went out at around 8 o'clock and did not come back until this morning. For small traders, that is a serious loss. Those who sell fish, milk and cold drinks watched a whole week of stock go bad. One trader told us she lost about 4,000 shillings in a single night. The power company says there was a fault at the substation, but this is the third outage this month. We are asking for clear notices before planned cuts, and for a number we can call that actually gets answered.",
